	\L_0254f:
	\L_024fb:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...'
	R
	'The King ordered me to...'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_0255d:
	!VAR0516 : 413!
	\L_0254f:
	\L_024fb:
	ZH 1:
	'Yahooooo!!'
	R
	'I’ll take care of you!!'
	R
	'You’ll be happy for sure!!'
	\L_025b0:
	ZH 1:
	'Thank you, King Rance.'
	R
	'I’ll follow you. Aah, I’ll do'
	R
	'anything you want!!'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_0248b:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, come over tomorrow.'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_024fb:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah... But...'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_0248b:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_024fb:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll go tomorrow, but...'
	\L_025b0:
	ZH 1:
	'Would it be okay if I go in'
	R
	'the afternoon?'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_0248b:
	ZH 1:
	'Why?'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_024fb:
	ZH 1:
	'Well... Because... You know...'
	\L_025b0:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s going to be our first'
	R
	'night as newlyweds...'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_0248b:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_025b0:
	ZH 1:
	'Do what you want...!!'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_024a7:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph.'
	R
	'He’s totally focused on her.'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_0248b:
	ZH 1:
	'Shinoda!'
	R
	'Tomorrow afternoon!!'
	R
	'Don’t forget to come to the'
	R
	'castle!!'
	\L_025b0:
	\L_025a3:
	\L_024fb:
	ZH 1:
	'Sure, suuuure.'
